<p>First original album, recorded at <strong>Estúdio Asas</strong> in São Paulo and produced by <strong>Edson X</strong>. Marcelo Nicchio contributed to the concept and songwriting and recorded drums.</p><p>The album featured guest appearances by <strong>Paulão de Carvalho</strong> (Velhas Virgens), vocals; <strong>Finho</strong> (band 365), vocals; and <strong>Grupo Emosamba</strong> on the introductory vignette. Several videos from the recording sessions have been preserved.</p><p>The work was independently released on CD in <strong>1998</strong>.</p><figure class="thread-media thread-media--pair thread-media--album-pair"><div class="thread-media-pair__images"><a aria-label="Open the original Meu Querido Diário cover at full size" href="/assets/archive/music/coitado-do-proximo/1997-1998-meu-querido-diario/coitadodoproximo_00_cdmeuqueridodiario_1997.jpg" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><img alt="Original cover of Meu Querido Diário, Coitado do Próximo’s first album." decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/archive/music/coitado-do-proximo/1997-1998-meu-querido-diario/coitadodoproximo_00_cdmeuqueridodiario_1997.jpg" width="1254" height="1254"/></a><a aria-label="Open the Meu Querido Diário recording-session image from Estúdio Asas at full size" href="/assets/archive/music/coitado-do-proximo/1997-1998-meu-querido-diario/coitadodoproximo_00_estudioasas1997_300kb.jpg" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><img alt="Record of the Meu Querido Diário recording sessions at Estúdio Asas in 1997." decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/assets/archive/music/coitado-do-proximo/1997-1998-meu-querido-diario/coitadodoproximo_00_estudioasas1997_300kb.jpg" width="1448" height="1086"/></a></div><figcaption><strong>Meu Querido Diário · original cover and Estúdio Asas · 1997–1998.</strong><span class="thread-media-note">The original first-album cover is shown alongside a surviving record of the recording sessions at Estúdio Asas in São Paulo.</span><span class="thread-media-pair__open"><a class="thread-media-open" href="/assets/archive/music/coitado-do-proximo/1997-1998-meu-querido-diario/coitadodoproximo_00_cdmeuqueridodiario_1997.jpg" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Open cover ↗</a><a class="thread-media-open" href="/assets/archive/music/coitado-do-proximo/1997-1998-meu-querido-diario/coitadodoproximo_00_estudioasas1997_300kb.jpg" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Open studio image ↗</a></span></figcaption></figure><p class="archive-reading-action album-audio-teaser"><a class="archive-text-link" href="/en/music/meu-querido-diario/#preserved-audio">Listen to 5 recovered Meu Querido Diário tracks →</a></p><div class="video-library" aria-label="Videos and media" aria-labelledby="music-album-1997-video-title"><div class="video-library__head"><strong id="music-album-1997-video-title">Videos &amp; Media · 1</strong><span>Estúdio Asas · 1997</span></div><div class="video-library__group"><div class="video-library__label"><strong>Recording Meu Querido Diário</strong></div><p class="video-library__description">Playlist with preserved video records from the recording sessions for Coitado do Próximo's first album at Estúdio Asas in 1997.</p><div class="video-library__actions"><a class="video-pill" href="https://youtube.com/playlist?list=PLEPyDyWt1dXI&amp;si=1K4RUsYEvLbVaALq" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Open playlist</a></div></div></div>
